From: Oh_My_SLAM maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Validate final lattice footprints and reject invalid map indices

Validate continuous final yaw and filled footprint cells, sample translation and
rotation between poses, and fall back only to an independently valid raw path.
Reject unsafe same-cell returns and nonfinite/exclusive-upper map indices.
Check smoother iteration worldToMap failures before costmap access.

